# Issue #77, second pull request: notes/experiments/i77_kernels/step_times.py run 7 times
# on the base (f058aba) and 7 times on the change, alternating, on an otherwise idle
# machine. Runs 1 to 3 of the change ran its commit 8 before a change of a condition
# that no timed path takes, runs 4 to 7 its commit 9 (the same package code; the hashes
# a6f241a and e5ced30 are those before their decision rows were renumbered). The
# summary gives each configuration's median over the 7 runs of the per-run medians, and
# the ratio change / base of those medians.

